# MasteryFlow Environment Configuration
# To send live OTP emails to real user inboxes (e.g. Gmail):
# 1. Go to your Google Account -> Security -> 2-Step Verification -> App Passwords
# 2. Create an App Password for 'MasteryFlow' (16 lowercase letters)
# 3. Enter your email and the 16-character password below:

SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USERNAME=
SMTP_PASSWORD=
SMTP_FROM_EMAIL=
SMTP_FROM_NAME=MasteryFlow Adaptive Learning
SMTP_USE_TLS=true
